.TH XIL\-PRODUCE "1" "2026\-07\-23" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-produce
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-produce
[-h] (--episode EPISODE | --tag TAG) [--show SHOW] [--script SCRIPT] [--dry-run] [--reconcile] [--apply] [--force] [--start-from START_FROM] [--stop-at STOP_AT] [--terse] [--gen-sfx] [--gen-music] [--gen-ambience] [--sfx-music] [--local-only] [--backend BACKEND] [--chatterbox-python PATH] [--voice-refs DIR] [--exaggeration FLOAT] [--cfg-weight FLOAT] [--sfx-backend BACKEND] [--audioldm2-python PATH] [--audioldm2-guidance FLOAT] [--audioldm2-steps INT] [--audioldm2-negative-prompt STR] [--stableaudio-python PATH] [--stableaudio-guidance FLOAT] [--stableaudio-steps INT] [--stableaudio-negative-prompt STR] [--stableaudio-seed INT]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Voice Generation — generate voice stems via ElevenLabs

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,EPISODE\/\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S01E01) — derives cast and SFX config paths

.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01)

.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SHOW\/\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-script\fR \fI\,SCRIPT\/\fR
Path to parsed script JSON (default: derived from cast config)

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview all lines and TTS cost without API calls

.TP
\fB\-\-reconcile\fR
Re\-link existing stems to new seq filenames after a re\-parse (reads stem
manifest, proposes renames, no TTS calls). Add \-\-apply to execute.

.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
With \-\-reconcile: execute the renames instead of dry\-run preview.

.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite existing stem files instead of skipping them. Use with \-\-range to
regenerate specific lines. WARNING: incurs ElevenLabs API cost for every stem
in range.

.TP
\fB\-\-start\-from\fR \fI\,START_FROM\/\fR
Start generation from sequence number N (for resuming)

.TP
\fB\-\-stop\-at\fR \fI\,STOP_AT\/\fR
Stop generation at sequence number N, inclusive (for previewing a section)

.TP
\fB\-\-terse\fR
Truncate each line to 3 words to minimize TTS character cost

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-sfx\fR
Generate SFX and BEAT stems

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-music\fR
Generate music stems

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-ambience\fR
Generate ambience stems

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-music\fR
(deprecated) shorthand for \-\-gen\-sfx \-\-gen\-music \-\-gen\-ambience

.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Only place stems for effects already present in SFX/; skip API generation

.TP
\fB\-\-backend\fR \fI\,BACKEND\/\fR
TTS backend for dialogue voice stems. 'elevenlabs' (default) calls the
ElevenLabs API. 'gtts' generates a flat\-voice draft via Google Translate TTS
at no cost — all characters sound the same, useful for checking episode
duration before spending API credits. 'chatterbox' uses local Chatterbox TTS
with per\-character voice cloning from voice_refs/<key>.wav reference clips —
near\-production quality, free, GPU\-accelerated (all [tags] stripped).
'chatterbox\-turbo' uses the local Chatterbox Turbo model in the same venv\-
chatterbox: it natively renders 19 paralinguistic tags — [angry] [fear]
[surprised] [happy] [crying] [sarcastic] [whispering] [dramatic] [narration]
[advertisement] [laugh] [chuckle] [sigh] [gasp] [groan] [cough] [sniff]
[shush] [clear throat] — and strips every other bracketed tag. Spelling is
exact: there are no plural forms ([laugh], not [laughs]). Requires reference
clips >5s and ignores \-\-exaggeration/\-\-cfg\-weight. Requires: pip install xil\-
pipeline[tts\-alt] (gtts) or a configured venv\-chatterbox (chatterbox /
chatterbox\-turbo).

.TP
\fB\-\-chatterbox\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable in the chatterbox venv (default: auto\-detect
./venv\-chatterbox/bin/python3). Used with \-\-backend chatterbox or chatterbox\-
turbo.

.TP
\fB\-\-voice\-refs\fR \fI\,DIR\/\fR
Directory of <speaker_key>.wav reference clips for Chatterbox zero\-shot voice
cloning (default: <workspace>/voice_refs/). Missing refs fall back to
Chatterbox's default voice.

.TP
\fB\-\-exaggeration\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Chatterbox emotion exaggeration level: 0.0 = flat/monotone, 1.0 = dramatically
expressive (default: 0.5). Used only with \-\-backend chatterbox (ignored by
chatterbox\-turbo).

.TP
\fB\-\-cfg\-weight\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Chatterbox CFG weight controlling pacing/delivery: lower values (e.g. 0.3)
produce slower, more deliberate speech and help compensate for acceleration at
high exaggeration (default: 0.5). Used only with \-\-backend chatterbox (ignored
by chatterbox\-turbo).

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-backend\fR \fI\,BACKEND\/\fR
Backend for SFX/music/ambience generation, independent of the dialogue
\-\-backend. 'elevenlabs' (default) calls the ElevenLabs Sound Effects API.
'audioldm2' uses a local AudioLDM 2 Large diffusion model (venv\-audioldm2) —
free, GPU\-accelerated, writes backend\-tagged assets to
SFX/<slug>.audioldm2.mp3. 'stableaudio' uses a local Stable Audio Open 1.0
model (shares venv\-audioldm2; 44.1 kHz stereo, up to 47s per clip; HF license\-
gated weights) and writes SFX/<slug>.stableaudio.mp3.

.TP
\fB\-\-audioldm2\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable in the AudioLDM 2 venv (default: auto\-detect
./venv\-audioldm2/bin/python3). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend audioldm2.

.TP
\fB\-\-audioldm2\-guidance\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
AudioLDM 2 guidance scale — how closely generation follows the prompt
(default: 3.5). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend audioldm2.

.TP
\fB\-\-audioldm2\-steps\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
AudioLDM 2 diffusion inference steps — higher is slower but cleaner (default:
200). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend audioldm2.

.TP
\fB\-\-audioldm2\-negative\-prompt\fR \fI\,STR\/\fR
AudioLDM 2 negative prompt (default: 'low quality, noise'). Used only with
\-\-sfx\-backend audioldm2.

.TP
\fB\-\-stableaudio\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable for the Stable Audio backend (default: auto\-
detect the shared venv\-audioldm2 Python — StableAudioPipeline ships in the
same diffusers install). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend stableaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-stableaudio\-guidance\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Stable Audio guidance scale — how closely generation follows the prompt
(default: 7.0). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend stableaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-stableaudio\-steps\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
Stable Audio diffusion inference steps — higher is slower but cleaner
(default: 100). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend stableaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-stableaudio\-negative\-prompt\fR \fI\,STR\/\fR
Stable Audio negative prompt (default: 'low quality, average quality'). Used
only with \-\-sfx\-backend stableaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-stableaudio\-seed\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
Reproducibility seed for Stable Audio generation (default: nondeterministic).
Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend stableaudio.

